{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>el beit ha-nashim sheni.</b> The meaning: a second time. And the word comes in masculine form, like אך בפעם הזה. And the meaning of 'guardian of the concubines' is that after the king lies with her, no other man may lie with her, for it would be a disgrace to the king; rather, she is among the concubines — unless the king does not find favor with her, then he releases her."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:06.446769116Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}